msgstr "4\\. Precautions"

msgid "NaN / Inf 处理"
msgstr "NaN / Inf Handling"

msgid "`equal_nan=True` 将 NaN 视为相等。若需要严格检测 NaN 差异，设为 `False`。"
msgstr "`equal_nan=True` treats NaN as equal. If you need to strictly detect NaN differences, set it to `False`."

msgid "整数类型"
msgstr "Integer type"

msgid "整数和布尔类型不允许任何误差，需严格一致。在跨设备比对时，务必确保数据已移至同一设备（如 CPU），以避免底层表示差异带来的误判。"
msgstr "Integer and boolean types do not allow any errors and must be strictly consistent. When comparing across devices, move the data to the same device (such as the CPU) to avoid false mismatches caused by underlying representation differences."
